"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Cajun/Creole, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"ORVWMFwF5qTWy9Cbahf0Pg","review_id":"oL5oqM54T5dc9DHy3EgNoA","date":"2012-05-25T22:54:58","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.938608705997467,"text_excerpt":"Having just had one of the best - if not THE best - meals of my life at Commander's Palace's jazz brunch, I was very excited to come to its sister restaurant, Cafe Adelaide, for a lovely late dinner last night. First of all, our server Raj was phenomenal. He was always carefully attentive at the right times, incredibly poised and gracious, and he avoided approaching our table when he could tell that we were having a very intense conversation, which we often were. The meal started with wine - we got a bottle of Malbec, which was delicious. Cafe Adelaide's bread is a small french baguette with soft whipped butter. I ordered the Louisiana Crabmeat Gnocchi (Louisiana jumbo lump crabmeat with ..."},{"business_id":"ORVWMFwF5qTWy9Cbahf0Pg","review_id":"WWGcVBP7J3P7ZregZzq_sg","date":"2008-06-02T03:37:14","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9346555471420288,"text_excerpt":"Yeah---I gave them 5 stars, which is not usual for someone like me since I have worked in the industry for a good 10 years in New Orleans. So what if it's a hotel restaurant--I can say so what? This is NOT like the other Brennan restaurant's I have ate at in this city, and I can tell you that I have at almost every single one in the proximity of Cafe Adelaide and by far this was the most memorable one. I was very, very, very impressed and satisfied with the service and the quality of the food. Someone at the firm was leaving and for a last lunch, we decided to walk over to Cafe Adelaide which is located in the Loew's Hotel on Poydras St. in the CBD area of New Orleans. For parking, you ma..."},{"business_id":"ORVWMFwF5qTWy9Cbahf0Pg","review_id":"9MjIaRZs7LhvIC-AR30IyQ","date":"2017-12-21T06:23:24","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.931675136089325,"text_excerpt":"It's been several years since we've eaten here, so I figured it was time to give it a try again. The last time we went here was in the heat of the summer and their air conditioning wasn't working, so the meal just wasn't pleasant. I'm happy to report the temperature of the restaurant was perfect tonight! The Christmas decorations were also a wonderful touch! First and foremost, the biggest plus to coming here (at least to me) is FREE validated valet parking. I truly can't think of any other restaurants downtown that offer such s sweet perk. The food- everything we had was very good. The only thing I'd say was mediocre was my corn and crab bisque. The right level of creaminess, but the spi..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"ORVWMFwF5qTWy9Cbahf0Pg","photo_id":"XuSwbERfHZ2YNy3OVP_BOg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/XuSwbERfHZ2YNy3OVP_BOg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8743467330932617},{"business_id":"ORVWMFwF5qTWy9Cbahf0Pg","photo_id":"HsNyLQHXepOWo64wYinQRg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/HsNyLQHXepOWo64wYinQRg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8581756353378296},{"business_id":"ORVWMFwF5qTWy9Cbahf0Pg","photo_id":"kX3vh-efu7xJXQiMMqmY0w","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/kX3vh-efu7xJXQiMMqmY0w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8449809551239014},{"business_id":"ORVWMFwF5qTWy9Cbahf0Pg","photo_id":"98HiXl640Js_8CpKJcQaIg","